      </li>
      <li>ensure that anyone authorised to process the data is bound by confidentiality;</li>
      <li>
        take appropriate technical and organisational security measures as required by Article 32 of
        the UK GDPR;
      </li>
      <li>
        not engage another processor without your prior written authorisation. You give general
